## Places (public coordinates) and facts on screen (only what the narration says)
- Sealand / HM Fort Roughs (Roughs Tower): 51.8944° N 1.4825° E — OpenStreetMap node 5703209919 «Roughs Tower» and relation
  6701391 «Sealand» (51.89439 N 1.48254 E); Wikipedia «Principality of Sealand» gives 51°53′40″ N 1°28′57″ E (the same point).
  The pin is on this point (the platform itself is too small to see in 10 m imagery).
  The dashed line runs to Landguard Point, Felixstowe (51.9355° N 1.3200° E, read off the z13 imagery: the nearest Suffolk shore
  toward Harwich harbour); great circle 12.1 km. On screen «≈ 13 км», as the narration says («примерно в тринадцати километрах
  от берега»; SCRIPT/RESEARCH: ≈ 7 nautical miles ≈ 13 km off the Suffolk coast, Wikipedia).
  On screen: «сентябрь 1967», «Великобритания» (over the land, wide view only), «Рафс-Тауэр», «морской форт», «Северное море»,
  «≈ 13 км», «княжество Силенд». Not in this clip: the Chelmsford court, the 3-mile limit (next paragraph).
- Liberland (Gornja Siga): label/pin at the centre of the OSM «Siga» ring, 45.7677° N 18.8720° E (Wikipedia «Liberland»:
  45°46′ N 18°52′30″ E). The ring lies on the west (left, Croatian-side) bank of the Danube. «Хорватия» is placed on the west
  bank (45.80 N 18.818 E), «Сербия» on the east bank (45.778 N 18.958 E), «Дунай» on the river (45.818 N 18.857 E).
  On screen: «2015», «Либерленд», «Дунай», «Хорватия», «Сербия», «≈ 7 км²»; the outline pulses once at «этот участок ничей».
- Hutt River: 28.0744° S 114.4707° E (Wikipedia «Principality of Hutt River», 28°04′28″ S 114°28′15″ E), about 35 km
  north-north-west of Northampton, Western Australia (Wikipedia: 28.3511 S 114.6281 E). No boundary is drawn (no public outline of
  the farm was found); only the pin. On screen: «Австралия» (globe), «1970», «Хатт-Ривер», «≈ 75 км²» (narration «около
  семидесяти пяти квадратных километров»), «Западная Австралия». The ~500 km from Perth is not said, so it is not shown.

